### Add organization admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations/current/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Org 2",
  "lastName": "Technician 4",
  "email": "org2Technician4@test.com",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "role": "TECHNICIAN",
  "password": "Technician@123"
}

